d</code></td>\n<td>error</td>\n<td>病毒/恶意文件检出</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"日志采样策略\">日志采样策略</h3><p>高流量系统不可能记录每一次上传的完整日志。采样策略：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>成功上传</strong>：1% 采样（保留统计意义）</li>\n<li><strong>失败/错误上传</strong>：100% 记录（每一次失败都值得排查）</li>\n<li><strong>慢上传（P99）</strong>：100% 记录</li>\n<li><strong>大文件（&gt; 100 MB）</strong>：100% 记录</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"分布式链路追踪\">分布式链路追踪</h2><h3 id=\"span-结构设计\">Span 结构设计</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    S1[upload-gateway&lt;br/&gt;接收请求] --&gt; S2[upload-service&lt;br/&gt;业务处理]&#10;    S2 --&gt; S3[validation&lt;br/&gt;文件校验]&#10;    S2 --&gt; S4[virus-scan&lt;br/&gt;病毒扫描]&#10;    S2 --&gt; S5[s3-put&lt;br/&gt;存储写入]&#10;    S5 --&gt; S6[s3-multipart-init]&#10;    S5 --&gt; S7[s3-upload-part ×N]&#10;    S5 --&gt; S8[s3-complete-multipart]\">graph TD\n    S1[upload-gateway&lt;br/&gt;接收请求] --&gt; S2[upload-service&lt;br/&gt;业务处理]\n    S2 --&gt; S3[validation&lt;br/&gt;文件校验]\n    S2 --&gt; S4[virus-scan&lt;br/&gt;病毒扫描]\n    S2 --&gt; S5[s3-put&lt;br/&gt;存储写入]\n    S5 --&gt; S6[s3-multipart-init]\n    S5 --&gt; S7[s3-upload-part ×N]\n    S5 --&gt; S8[s3-complete-multipart]</pre><p>每个 Span 携带的关键属性：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { trace, SpanKind } from &#39;@opentelemetry/api&#39;;&#10;&#10;const tracer = trace.getTracer(&#39;upload-service&#39;);&#10;&#10;async function uploadFile(file: UploadedFile) {&#10;  return tracer.startActiveSpan(&#10;    &#39;upload.process&#39;,&#10;    {&#10;      kind: SpanKind.SERVER,&#10;      attributes: {&#10;        &#39;upload.file_name&#39;: file.name,&#10;        &#39;upload.file_size&#39;: file.size,&#10;        &#39;upload.content_type&#39;: file.contentType,&#10;        &#39;upload.user_id&#39;: file.userId,&#10;      },&#10;    },&#10;    async (span) =&gt; {&#10;      try {&#10;        await tracer.startActiveSpan(&#39;upload.validate&#39;, async (validateSpan) =&gt; {&#10;          await validateFile(file);&#10;          validateSpan.end();&#10;        });&#10;&#10;        await tracer.startActiveSpan(&#39;upload.store&#39;, async (storeSpan) =&gt; {&#10;          const result = await storeToS3(file);&#10;          storeSpan.setAttribute(&#39;storage.key&#39;, result.key);&#10;          storeSpan.end();&#10;        });&#10;&#10;        span.setStatus({ code: SpanStatusCode.OK });&#10;      } catch (err) {&#10;        span.setStatus({ code: SpanStatusCode.ERROR, message: err.message });&#10;        span.recordException(err);&#10;        throw err;&#10;      } finally {&#10;        span.end();&#10;      }&#10;    },&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { trace, SpanKind } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@opentelemetry/api'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> tracer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trace.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getTracer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'upload-service'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F